# Models (large binary AI model artifacts at the repo root only).
# IMPORTANT: do NOT use a bare `models/` pattern here — it would also ignore
# `src/models/` (the Pydantic data-model package), and that has historically
# broken the entire closed loop because none of those modules were ever
# committed. Anchor the rule at the repo root with a leading slash.
/models/
.artifacts/
.pip-cache/
auto-agent-workflow/

